    {
      "item": "Q01",
      "original_chinese": "我能辨认对方说的是哪块拼图。",
      "scale": "1-5；无法判断/不适用单列；不是0",
      "working_english_translation": "I could identify which piece my partner was referring to."
    },
    {
      "item": "Q02",
      "original_chinese": "我能理解对方想把拼块放在哪里。",
      "scale": "1-5；无法判断/不适用单列；不是0",
      "working_english_translation": "I could understand where my partner wanted to place a piece."
    },
    {
      "item": "Q03",
      "original_chinese": "我能判断对方是否理解了我的建议。",
      "scale": "1-5；无法判断/不适用单列；不是0",
      "working_english_translation": "I could judge whether my partner understood my suggestion."
    },
    {
      "item": "Q04",
      "original_chinese": "我能向对方清楚说明自己想把拼块放在哪里。",
      "scale": "1-5；无法判断/不适用单列；不是0",
      "working_english_translation": "I could clearly explain where I wanted to place a piece."
    },
    {
      "item": "Q05",
      "original_chinese": "我能跟上对方正在做的事情。",
      "scale": "1-5；无法判断/不适用单列；不是0",
      "working_english_translation": "I could follow what my partner was doing."
    },
    {
      "item": "Q06",
      "original_chinese": "我清楚拼图当时的完成进度。",
      "scale": "1-5；无法判断/不适用单列；不是0",
      "working_english_translation": "I knew the current progress of the puzzle."
    },
    {
      "item": "Q07",
